WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.719
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:17.027
What do they see?

3
00:00:17.028 --> 00:00:25.511
They see a merry-go-round!

4
00:00:25.512 --> 00:00:37.050
The blobs go up to the merry-go-round.

5
00:00:37.051 --> 00:00:46.125
There's a horse.

6
00:00:46.126 --> 00:00:57.270
There's a donkey.

7
00:00:57.271 --> 00:01:11.930
There's a giraffe.

8
00:01:11.931 --> 00:01:23.541
There's a zebra.

9
00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:35.411
There's an elephant.

10
00:01:35.412 --> 00:01:42.758
Blobs, what's wrong?

11
00:01:42.759 --> 00:01:47.879
Oh! There's a scary lion!

12
00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:56.337
The blobs run.

13
00:01:56.338 --> 00:02:06.434
Whew, the lion is gone.

14
00:02:06.435 --> 00:02:12.556
Oh no! The lion's back!

15
00:02:12.557 --> 00:02:18.194
Silly blobs!

16
00:02:18.195 --> 00:02:23.216
Good-bye!

